    },
    {
      "text": "layers of fabric, head scarves,",
      "start": 22.32,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 26.48
    },
    {
      "text": "sometimes several garments at once. The",
      "start": 24.2,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 28.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Bedouin of Arabia, the Tuareg of the",
      "start": 26.48,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 30.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Sahara, desert peoples across North",
      "start": 28.8,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 33.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Africa and the Middle East, all of them,",
      "start": 30.96,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 35.28
    },
    {
      "text": "in the most extreme heat imaginable,",
      "start": 33.16,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 37.76
    },
    {
      "text": "chose to wear more, not less. And your",
      "start": 35.28,
      "duration": 4.88,
      "end": 40.16
    },
    {
      "text": "instinct screams that this is insane.",
      "start": 37.76,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 42.4
    },
    {
      "text": "When you're hot, you take clothes off.",
      "start": 40.16,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 44.44
    },
    {
      "text": "You want your skin exposed to the air.",
      "start": 42.4,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 46.72
    },
    {
      "text": "You want a breeze on your bare arms. The",
      "start": 44.44,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 48.56
    },
    {
      "text": "idea of putting on heavy layers in a",
      "start": 46.72,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 50.48
    },
    {
      "text": "blazing desert sounds like a recipe for",
      "start": 48.56,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 52.76
    },
    {
      "text": "heatstroke. So, how have these people,",
      "start": 50.48,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 54.76
    },
    {
      "text": "who understand desert survival better",
      "start": 52.76,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 56.84
    },
    {
      "text": "than anyone on Earth, who have refined",
      "start": 54.76,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 58.4
    },
    {
      "text": "their way of life over countless",
      "start": 56.84,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 60.52
    },
    {
      "text": "generations, come to ex- actly the",
      "start": 58.4,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 62.36
    },
    {
      "text": "opposite conclusion? The answer is a",
      "start": 60.52,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 64.52
    },
    {
      "text": "beautiful lesson in how heat actually",
      "start": 62.36,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 66.56
    },
    {
      "text": "works. And it turns out these desert",
      "start": 64.52,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 68.2
    },
    {
      "text": "peoples understood the physics of",
      "start": 66.56,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "end": 70.28
    },
    {
      "text": "staying cool far better than our gut",
      "start": 68.2,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 72.24
    },
    {
      "text": "instinct ever could. Covering up, it",
      "start": 70.28,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 73.96
    },
    {
      "text": "turns out, isn't just more comfortable",
      "start": 72.24,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 76.4
    },
    {
      "text": "in extreme desert heat. It can genuinely",
      "start": 73.96,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 78.32
    },
    {
      "text": "keep you cooler, and it can save your",
      "start": 76.4,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 80.88
    },
    {
      "text": "life. Here's why. To understand this,",
      "start": 78.32,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 82.84
    },
    {
      "text": "you first have to understand where the",
      "start": 80.88,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 84.72
    },
    {
      "text": "heat is actually coming from in a",
      "start": 82.84,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "end": 86.08
    },
    {
      "text": "desert, because it's not just the",
      "start": 84.72,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "end": 88.08
    },
    {
      "text": "temperature of the air. There are two",
      "start": 86.08,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 90.2
    },
    {
      "text": "separate enemies attacking your body",
      "start": 88.08,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 92.28
    },
    {
      "text": "under that desert sun. The first enemy",
      "start": 90.2,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 94.8
    },
    {
      "text": "is the sun itself, the direct radiation.",
      "start": 92.28,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 96.44
    },
    {
      "text": "In the desert, there's little cloud",
      "start": 94.8,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "end": 98.52
    },
    {
      "text": "cover and often no shade for miles, so",
      "start": 96.44,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 101.0
    },
    {
      "text": "the sun's rays hammer down directly onto",
      "start": 98.52,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 103.24
    },
    {
      "text": "your skin with tremendous force. This",
      "start": 101.0,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 105.12
    },
    {
      "text": "radiant energy heats your skin the way",
      "start": 103.24,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 107.36
    },
    {
      "text": "it heats a dark car, pouring energy into",
      "start": 105.12,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 109.36
    },
    {
      "text": "your body from above. If your skin is",
      "start": 107.36,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 111.16
    },
    {
      "text": "bare and exposed, it takes the full",
      "start": 109.36,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 113.28
    },
    {
      "text": "force of that solar assault directly.",
      "start": 111.16,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 115.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Your skin burns and heat floods into",
      "start": 113.28,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 117.6
    },
    {
      "text": "your body. The second enemy is the air",
      "start": 115.52,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 119.48
    },
    {
      "text": "itself. When the air temperature is",
      "start": 117.6,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 121.28
    },
    {
      "text": "higher than your body temperature, which",
      "start": 119.48,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 123.52
    },
    {
      "text": "in an extreme desert it absolutely can",
      "start": 121.28,
      "duration": 4.84,
      "end": 126.12
    },
    {
      "text": "be, the hot air actively heats you up.",
      "start": 123.52,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 127.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Think about that carefully. We're used",
      "start": 126.12,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 129.92
    },
    {
      "text": "to air cooling us down because normally",
      "start": 127.84,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 132.48
    },
    {
      "text": "the air is cooler than our roughly 98°",
      "start": 129.92,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 134.36
    },
    {
      "text": "bodies. But when the surrounding air is",
      "start": 132.48,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "end": 135.92
    },
    {
      "text": "120°",
      "start": 134.36,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "end": 137.92
    },
    {
      "text": "hotter than your body, that air is no",
      "start": 135.92,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 140.04
    },
    {
      "text": "longer cooling you. It's cooking you.",
      "start": 137.92,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 142.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Every breath of wind, every gust across",
      "start": 140.04,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 144.72
    },
    {
      "text": "your bare skin is now delivering heat",
      "start": 142.36,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 146.32
    },
    {
      "text": "into your body instead of taking it",
      "start": 144.72,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 148.64
    },
    {
      "text": "away. In that situation, exposing your",
      "start": 146.32,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 150.72
    },
    {
      "text": "skin to the air doesn't cool you down at",
      "start": 148.64,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 152.48
    },
    {
      "text": "all. It heats you up. And this is the",
      "start": 150.72,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 154.72
    },
    {
      "text": "first great insight of desert clothing.",
      "start": 152.48,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 156.68
    },
    {
      "text": "If the air is hotter than your body,",
      "start": 154.72,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 159.12
    },
    {
      "text": "then bare skin is a liability, not an",
      "start": 156.68,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 161.24
    },
    {
      "text": "advantage. That breeze you're craving on",
      "start": 159.12,
      "duration": 4.84,
      "end": 163.96
    },
    {
      "text": "your naked arms is actually pouring heat",
      "start": 161.24,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 166.0
    },
    {
      "text": "into you. So, the desert peoples cover",
      "start": 163.96,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 168.16
    },
    {
      "text": "their skin, creating a barrier between",
      "start": 166.0,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 170.24
    },
    {
      "text": "their bodies and both of those enemies,",
      "start": 168.16,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 172.32
    },
    {
      "text": "the burning sun above and the scorching",
      "start": 170.24,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 174.32
    },
    {
      "text": "air around them. The clothing blocks the",
      "start": 172.32,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 176.52
    },
    {
      "text": "direct solar radiation from reaching and",
      "start": 174.32,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "end": 178.2
    },
    {
      "text": "burning the skin, and it shields the",
      "start": 176.52,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 180.32
    },
    {
      "text": "body from the superheated air. Right",
      "start": 178.2,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 182.44
    },
    {
      "text": "away, covering up is protecting you from",
      "start": 180.32,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 184.52
    },
    {
      "text": "two sources of heat that bare skin would",
      "start": 182.44,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 186.96
    },
    {
      "text": "leave you fully exposed to. But blocking",
      "start": 184.52,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 189.08
    },
    {
      "text": "heat is only half of the genius because",
      "start": 186.96,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 191.12
    },
    {
      "text": "if all the clothing did was block heat,",
      "start": 189.08,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 193.0
    },
    {
      "text": "it might also trap your body's own",
      "start": 191.12,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 195.16
    },
    {
      "text": "warmth and cook you from the inside. The",
      "start": 193.0,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 196.8
    },
    {
      "text": "real brilliance is in how desert",
      "start": 195.16,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 199.12
    },
    {
      "text": "clothing manages your body's own cooling",
      "start": 196.8,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "end": 200.68
    },
    {
      "text": "system. And this is where it becomes",
      "start": 199.12,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "end": 203.0
    },
    {
      "text": "truly ingenious. And the secret is that",
      "start": 200.68,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 205.2
    },
    {
      "text": "the clothing is loose and worn in",
      "start": 203.0,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 207.72
    },
    {
      "text": "layers, creating trapped air. Here's the",
      "start": 205.2,
      "duration": 4.84,
      "end": 210.04
    },
    {
      "text": "key. Desert robes are not tight against",
      "start": 207.72,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 212.16
    },
    {
      "text": "the skin. They're loose and flowing,",
      "start": 210.04,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 213.84
    },
    {
      "text": "which means there's a layer of air",
      "start": 212.16,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 215.48
    },
    {
      "text": "trapped between the fabric and your",
      "start": 213.84,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 217.8
    },
    {
      "text": "body. And that trapped layer of air is",
      "start": 215.48,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 220.04
    },
    {
      "text": "the whole secret because air is actually",
      "start": 217.8,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 222.32
    },
    {
      "text": "an excellent insulator. That pocket of",
      "start": 220.04,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 224.68
    },
    {
      "text": "trapped air acts as a buffer zone, a",
      "start": 222.32,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 227.08
    },
    {
      "text": "barrier that slows the transfer of heat",
      "start": 224.68,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 229.2
    },
    {
      "text": "from the scorching outside world to your",
      "start": 227.08,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 231.56
    },
    {
      "text": "skin. It's It's exact same principle",
      "start": 229.2,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 233.24
    },
    {
      "text": "that makes a double-paned window",
      "start": 231.56,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 235.52
    },
    {
      "text": "insulate better than a single pane or",
      "start": 233.24,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 237.92
    },
    {
      "text": "why a loose down jacket keeps you warm.",
      "start": 235.52,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 239.92
    },
    {
      "text": "The trapped air does the work. In the",
      "start": 237.92,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 242.08
    },
    {
      "text": "desert, that trapped air layer helps",
      "start": 239.92,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 244.0
    },
    {
      "text": "keep the outside heat from reaching your",
      "start": 242.08,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 245.84
    },
    {
      "text": "body. But, it does something even more",
      "start": 244.0,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 247.96
    },
    {
      "text": "important than insulate. It creates a",
      "start": 245.84,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 250.52
    },
    {
      "text": "private microclimate against your skin.",
      "start": 247.96,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 252.32
    },
    {
      "text": "A little pocket of air that your own",
      "start": 250.52,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 254.48
    },
    {
      "text": "body can control and cool. And the way",
      "start": 252.32,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 256.68
    },
    {
      "text": "it cools that pocket is through the most",
      "start": 254.48,
      "duration": 5.32,
      "end": 259.8
    },
    {
      "text": "powerful tool your body has, sweat. Your",
      "start": 256.68,
      "duration": 5.2,
      "end": 261.88
    },
    {
      "text": "body's natural way of cooling itself is",
      "start": 259.8,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 263.6
    },
    {
      "text": "to sweat and then let that sweat",
      "start": 261.88,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 265.64
    },
    {
      "text": "evaporate. When sweat evaporates off",
      "start": 263.6,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 267.64
    },
    {
      "text": "your skin, turning from liquid into",
      "start": 265.64,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 269.88
    },
    {
      "text": "vapor, it absorbs a large amount of heat",
      "start": 267.64,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 271.72
    },
    {
      "text": "and carries it away, cooling you down.",
      "start": 269.88,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 273.36
    },
    {
      "text": "This is the single most important",
      "start": 271.72,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 275.4
    },
    {
      "text": "cooling mechanism the human body has.",
      "start": 273.36,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 277.0
    },
    {
      "text": "But, here's the problem in an open",
      "start": 275.4,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 279.48
    },
    {
      "text": "bare-skin situation in a windy desert.",
      "start": 277.0,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "end": 280.88
    },
    {
      "text": "When you're exposed, your sweat",
      "start": 279.48,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "end": 282.92
    },
    {
      "text": "evaporates almost instantly, flashing",
      "start": 280.88,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 284.68
    },
    {
      "text": "off your skin the moment it appears. And",
      "start": 282.92,
      "duration": 3.2,
      "end": 286.12
    },
    {
      "text": "while that does cool you a little, it",
      "start": 284.68,
      "duration": 2.8,
      "end": 287.48
    },
    {
      "text": "also means you lose that water",
      "start": 286.12,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 290.04
    },
    {
      "text": "incredibly fast. And in a desert, water",
      "start": 287.48,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 291.92
    },
    {
      "text": "is life. Sweat that evaporates in an",
      "start": 290.04,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "end": 293.92
    },
    {
      "text": "instant is water wasted. And dehydration",
      "start": 291.92,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 295.4
    },
    {
      "text": "is the fastest killer in the desert.",
      "start": 293.92,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "end": 297.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, watch what the loose robe does. As",
      "start": 295.4,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "end": 298.92
    },
    {
      "text": "you sweat inside your flowing robe, the",
      "start": 297.16,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "end": 300.6
    },
    {
      "text": "moisture evaporates. But, instead of",
      "start": 298.92,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 302.4
    },
    {
      "text": "vanishing instantly into the open air,",
      "start": 300.6,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "end": 304.16
    },
    {
      "text": "it evaporates into that trapped layer of",
      "start": 302.4,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "end": 305.92
    },
    {
      "text": "air between the fabric and your skin.",
      "start": 304.16,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "end": 308.04
    },
    {
      "text": "And as it evaporates there, it cools",
      "start": 305.92,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 309.88
    },
    {
      "text": "that trapped air, creating a pocket of",
      "start": 308.04,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 312.08
    },
    {
      "text": "cooler, more humid air right against",
      "start": 309.88,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 313.72
    },
    {
      "text": "your body. So, the space inside your",
      "start": 312.08,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "end": 315.6
    },
    {
      "text": "robe becomes noticeably cooler than the",
      "start": 313.72,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 317.48
    },
    {
      "text": "blistering air outside. You've created",
      "start": 315.6,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "end": 319.16
    },
    {
      "text": "your own personal cooling chamber,",
      "start": 317.48,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "end": 321.04
    },
    {
      "text": "powered by your own sweat, held in place",
      "start": 319.16,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "end": 322.56
    },
    {
      "text": "by the loose fabric. The clothing",
      "start": 321.04,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "end": 324.08
    },
    {
      "text": "captures the cooling power of your",
      "start": 322.56,
      "duration": 3.28,
      "end": 325.84
    },
    {
      "text": "evaporating sweat and keeps it close to",
      "start": 324.08,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "end": 327.24
    },
    {
      "text": "your body instead of letting it blow",
      "start": 325.84,
      "duration": 2.92,
      "end": 328.76
    },
    {
      "text": "away and be lost. And there's a",
      "start": 327.24,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "end": 330.76
    },
    {
      "text": "water-saving bonus that's absolutely",
      "start": 328.76,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 332.44
    },
    {
      "text": "critical for desert survival. Because",
      "start": 330.76,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "end": 334.2
    },
    {
      "text": "the air inside the robe becomes humid,",
      "start": 332.44,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 335.76
    },
    {
      "text": "your sweat evaporates more slowly and",
      "start": 334.2,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "end": 337.24
    },
    {
      "text": "more efficiently, which means you don't",
      "start": 335.76,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 339.08
    },
    {
      "text": "have to sweat as much to stay cool, and",
      "start": 337.24,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 340.92
    },
    {
      "text": "you lose less precious water. The robe",
      "start": 339.08,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "end": 342.48
    },
    {
      "text": "helps you get the maximum cooling",
      "start": 340.92,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 344.24
    },
    {
      "text": "benefit out of every drop of sweat,",
      "start": 342.48,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "end": 345.84
    },
    {
      "text": "conserving the water in your body. In a",
      "start": 344.24,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "end": 347.68
    },
    {
      "text": "place where dehydration can kill you in",
      "start": 345.84,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 349.76
    },
    {
      "text": "a day, this is not a minor detail. It's",
      "start": 347.68,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 351.68
    },
    {
      "text": "the difference between life and death.",
      "start": 349.76,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 353.68
    },
    {
      "text": "The loose robe cools you and helps keep",
      "start": 351.68,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 355.36
    },
    {
      "text": "you hydrated at the same time. And the",
      "start": 353.68,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "end": 357.2
    },
    {
      "text": "design gets even cleverer because these",
      "start": 355.36,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 358.96
    },
    {
      "text": "robes are engineered to keep the air",
      "start": 357.2,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "end": 360.76
    },
    {
      "text": "moving through that microclimate. The",
      "start": 358.96,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 363.16
    },
    {
      "text": "loose flowing cut of the robe allows air",
      "start": 360.76,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 365.44
    },
    {
      "text": "to circulate underneath it. As you move",
      "start": 363.16,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 367.6
    },
    {
      "text": "and walk, and as desert breezes blow,",
      "start": 365.44,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 369.04
    },
    {
      "text": "air flows up through the bottom of the",
      "start": 367.6,
      "duration": 3.12,
      "end": 370.72
    },
    {
      "text": "robe and out through the top and the",
      "start": 369.04,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 372.96
    },
    {
      "text": "neck, creating a gentle bellows effect,",
      "start": 370.72,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 375.04
    },
    {
      "text": "a constant circulation that carries away",
      "start": 372.96,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 376.96
    },
    {
      "text": "the heat and the moisture-laden air and",
      "start": 375.04,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 378.88
    },
    {
      "text": "draws in fresh air to be cooled again.",
      "start": 376.96,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 380.64
    },
    {
      "text": "The robe breathes. It's not a sealed",
      "start": 378.88,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "end": 382.12
    },
    {
      "text": "sweat box. It's a ventilated",
      "start": 380.64,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "end": 384.2
    },
    {
      "text": "self-cooling system, constantly flushing",
      "start": 382.12,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 385.88
    },
    {
      "text": "out hot air and refreshing the cool",
      "start": 384.2,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "end": 387.44
    },
    {
      "text": "pocket against the skin. The whole",
      "start": 385.88,
      "duration": 3.2,
      "end": 389.08
    },
    {
      "text": "garment works like a personal wearable",
      "start": 387.44,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "end": 390.8
    },
    {
      "text": "ventilation system, powered by nothing",
      "start": 389.08,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 392.56
    },
    {
      "text": "but movement and the breeze. Now, this",
      "start": 390.8,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "end": 394.2
    },
    {
      "text": "brings us to one of the most famous and",
      "start": 392.56,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 395.88
    },
    {
      "text": "puzzling details of all, the one that",
      "start": 394.2,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "end": 397.76
    },
    {
      "text": "seems to defy the whole logic of staying",
      "start": 395.88,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "end": 399.28
    },
    {
      "text": "cool. Because many desert peoples,",
      "start": 397.76,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "end": 400.8
    },
    {
      "text": "including the Bedouin, traditionally",
      "start": 399.28,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 403.04
    },
    {
      "text": "wear black robes, and this seems utterly",
      "start": 400.8,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "end": 405.44
    },
    {
      "text": "insane. We all know black absorbs heat",
      "start": 403.04,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 407.44
    },
    {
      "text": "and white reflects it. So, why on earth",
      "start": 405.44,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 409.12
    },
    {
      "text": "would anyone wear black in the blazing",
      "start": 407.44,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "end": 410.68
    },
    {
      "text": "desert sun? It seems like the worst",
      "start": 409.12,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "end": 412.64
    },
    {
      "text": "possible choice. But scientists actually",
      "start": 410.68,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 414.48
    },
    {
      "text": "studied this, and what they found is",
      "start": 412.64,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 416.28
    },
    {
      "text": "remarkable. In a famous experiment,",
      "start": 414.48,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 418.12
    },
    {
      "text": "researchers tested whether Bedouins",
      "start": 416.28,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 419.76
    },
    {
      "text": "wearing black robes were hotter than",
      "start": 418.12,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 421.44
    },
    {
      "text": "those wearing white robes in the desert.",
      "start": 419.76,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "end": 422.92
    },
    {
      "text": "And the astonishing result was that it",
      "start": 421.44,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "end": 424.68
    },
    {
      "text": "made no difference at all. The amount of",
      "start": 422.92,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 426.4
    },
    {
      "text": "heat reaching the body was the same",
      "start": 424.68,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 428.52
    },
    {
      "text": "whether the robe was black or white. And",
      "start": 426.4,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 430.48
    },
    {
      "text": "the reason why reveals the genius of the",
      "start": 428.52,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 432.0
    },
    {
      "text": "whole system. Yes, the black robe",
      "start": 430.48,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "end": 434.2
    },
    {
      "text": "absorbs more heat from the sun. But, and",
      "start": 432.0,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 436.0
    },
    {
      "text": "this is the crucial part, that extra",
      "start": 434.2,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 437.96
    },
    {
      "text": "heat is absorbed by the outer surface of",
      "start": 436.0,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "end": 439.72
    },
    {
      "text": "the loose robe, and it's carried away by",
      "start": 437.96,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "end": 441.68
    },
    {
      "text": "the air circulating underneath before it",
      "start": 439.72,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 443.56
    },
    {
      "text": "ever reaches the skin. In fact, the",
      "start": 441.68,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 445.6
    },
    {
      "text": "black fabric, by absorbing more heat,",
      "start": 443.56,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 447.16
    },
    {
      "text": "actually helps to intensify the",
      "start": 445.6,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "end": 449.04
    },
    {
      "text": "convection, the rising of hot air and",
      "start": 447.16,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 450.84
    },
    {
      "text": "the circulation of the bellows effect",
      "start": 449.04,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 452.72
    },
    {
      "text": "inside the robe, pulling even more air",
      "start": 450.84,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "end": 454.36
    },
    {
      "text": "through the system. The heat absorbed by",
      "start": 452.72,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "end": 456.12
    },
    {
      "text": "the black cloth gets lost to the moving",
      "start": 454.36,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "end": 457.76
    },
    {
      "text": "air before it can reach the body. So,",
      "start": 456.12,
      "duration": 3.08,
      "end": 459.2
    },
    {
      "text": "the black robe is no hotter than the",
      "start": 457.76,
      "duration": 2.92,
      "end": 460.68
    },
    {
      "text": "white one, and it comes with its own",
      "start": 459.2,
      "duration": 3.28,
      "end": 462.48
    },
    {
      "text": "advantages, offering better protection",
      "start": 460.68,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "end": 463.92
    },
    {
      "text": "from the sun's radiation reaching the",
      "start": 462.48,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 465.8
    },
    {
      "text": "skin, and being easier to produce from",
      "start": 463.92,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 467.92
    },
    {
      "text": "the black wool of desert goats. The very",
      "start": 465.8,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 469.88
    },
    {
      "text": "thing that seems like a fatal flaw, the",
      "start": 467.92,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 471.52
    },
    {
      "text": "heat-absorbing black color, is",
      "start": 469.88,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 473.2
    },
    {
      "text": "neutralized entirely by the brilliant",
      "start": 471.52,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 475.28
    },
    {
      "text": "design of the loose ventilated robe. And",
      "start": 473.2,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 476.68
    },
    {
      "text": "there's one more benefit to all this",
      "start": 475.28,
      "duration": 2.96,
      "end": 478.24
    },
    {
      "text": "covering up that we shouldn't forget",
      "start": 476.68,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 480.28
    },
    {
      "text": "beyond just temperature. The desert is a",
      "start": 478.24,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 482.64
    },
    {
      "text": "harsh, abrasive place, and the robes and",
      "start": 480.28,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 484.32
    },
    {
      "text": "head scarves protect against far more",
      "start": 482.64,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 485.96
    },
    {
      "text": "than heat. They shield the skin from",
      "start": 484.32,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 488.0
    },
    {
      "text": "brutal sunburn, which in constant desert",
      "start": 485.96,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 489.76
    },
    {
      "text": "sun would be a serious danger on its",
      "start": 488.0,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "end": 491.36
    },
    {
      "text": "own. They protect against the drying",
      "start": 489.76,
      "duration": 2.92,
      "end": 492.68
    },
    {
      "text": "wind that would strip moisture from",
      "start": 491.36,
      "duration": 2.92,
      "end": 494.28
    },
    {
      "text": "exposed skin. And critically, they",
      "start": 492.68,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 496.36
    },
    {
      "text": "defend against sand and dust, especially",
      "start": 494.28,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 498.32
    },
    {
      "text": "during the fierce sandstorms that scour",
      "start": 496.36,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 500.52
    },
    {
      "text": "the desert, wrapping the face and body",
      "start": 498.32,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 502.28
    },
    {
      "text": "to keep the stinging sand out of the",
      "start": 500.52,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 504.76
    },
    {
      "text": "eyes, nose, mouth, and skin. The full",
      "start": 502.28,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 506.88
    },
    {
      "text": "covering is a complete piece of survival",
      "start": 504.76,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 508.84
    },
    {
      "text": "equipment, guarding against every hazard",
      "start": 506.88,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 511.08
    },
    {
      "text": "the desert can throw at a human body.",
      "start": 508.84,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 513.04
    },
    {
      "text": "So, let's put the whole picture together",
      "start": 511.08,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 515.08
    },
    {
      "text": "and marvel at just how wrong our gut",
      "start": 513.04,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 517.32
    },
    {
      "text": "instinct was. In the extreme heat of the",
      "start": 515.08,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 519.48
    },
    {
      "text": "desert, covering up in loose, layered",
      "start": 517.32,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 522.0
    },
    {
      "text": "robes is not madness. It's a masterpiece",
      "start": 519.48,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 523.88
    },
    {
      "text": "of practical physics. The clothing",
      "start": 522.0,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 525.92
    },
    {
      "text": "blocks the burning sun and shields the",
      "start": 523.88,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 527.68
    },
    {
      "text": "body from air that is hotter than the",
      "start": 525.92,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 530.12
    },
    {
      "text": "body itself. The loose fit traps a layer",
      "start": 527.68,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 532.12
    },
    {
      "text": "of insulating air that buffers against",
      "start": 530.12,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 533.96
    },
    {
      "text": "the outside heat. That trapped air",
      "start": 532.12,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 535.96
    },
    {
      "text": "becomes a personal cooling chamber,",
      "start": 533.96,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 537.92
    },
    {
      "text": "chilled by the wearer's own evaporating",
      "start": 535.96,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 539.76
    },
    {
      "text": "sweat, which also conserves precious",
      "start": 537.92,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 541.68
    },
    {
      "text": "water by slowing evaporation. The",
      "start": 539.76,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 543.92
    },
    {
      "text": "flowing design ventilates and circulates",
      "start": 541.68,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 546.0
    },
    {
      "text": "the air, constantly refreshing the cool",
      "start": 543.92,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 548.16
    },
    {
      "text": "pocket against the skin. And even the",
      "start": 546.0,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 550.4
    },
    {
      "text": "color, whether black or white, is",
      "start": 548.16,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 552.24
    },
    {
      "text": "managed by the sheer cleverness of the",
      "start": 550.4,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 554.48
    },
    {
      "text": "design. Every single element works",
      "start": 552.24,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 556.64
    },
    {
      "text": "together into an elegant, wearable",
      "start": 554.48,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 558.48
    },
    {
      "text": "cooling system that beats bare skin",
      "start": 556.64,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 560.48
    },
    {
      "text": "decisively in the brutal desert",
      "start": 558.48,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 562.96
    },
    {
      "text": "environment. It's a stunning reminder",
      "start": 560.48,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 565.16
    },
    {
      "text": "that human instinct isn't always right,",
      "start": 562.96,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "end": 566.68
    },
    {
      "text": "and that the accumulated wisdom of",
      "start": 565.16,
      "duration": 2.96,
      "end": 568.12
    },
    {
      "text": "people who have lived somewhere for",
      "start": 566.68,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 570.16
    },
    {
      "text": "thousands of years often contains a",
      "start": 568.12,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 571.72
    },
    {
      "text": "deeper understanding than our quick",
      "start": 570.16,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "end": 573.52
    },
    {
      "text": "assumptions ever could. The desert",
      "start": 571.72,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 575.32
    },
    {
      "text": "peoples didn't cover up despite the",
      "start": 573.52,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 577.44
    },
    {
      "text": "heat. They covered up to defeat the heat",
      "start": 575.32,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 580.04
    },
    {
      "text": "using nothing but fabric, air, sweat,",
      "start": 577.44,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 581.96
    },
    {
      "text": "and an intimate, hard-won understanding",
      "start": 580.04,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 584.24
    },
    {
      "text": "of how the human body and the desert sun",
      "start": 581.96,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 586.44
    },
    {
      "text": "truly interact. So, the next time you",
      "start": 584.24,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 588.64
    },
    {
      "text": "see images of desert nomads wrapped head",
      "start": 586.44,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 590.76
    },
    {
      "text": "to toe in flowing robes under a blazing",
      "start": 588.64,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 592.6
    },
    {
      "text": "sun, and your instinct tells you they",
      "start": 590.76,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "end": 594.76
    },
    {
      "text": "must be roasting, remember the truth.",
      "start": 592.6,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 596.28
    },
    {
      "text": "They're almost certainly cooler than",
      "start": 594.76,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "end": 597.8
    },
    {
      "text": "you'd be standing next to them in a",
      "start": 596.28,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 599.6
    },
    {
